USE food_delivery_capstone_db;

-- ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- STEP 1: AI GENERATED QUERY (ORIGINAL FLAWED VERSION)
-- Generated by AI tool in response to the user prompt.
-- Flaws:
-- 1. Logical error: Calculates rank BEFORE filtering for completed_orders > 5.
-- 2. Ignores order_status (counts cancelled orders as completed).
-- 3. Fails to handle NULL delivery times when computing average delivery time.
-- ----------------------------------------------------------------------------

/*
-- AI ORIGINAL QUERY:
